WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.955
Explain why followers study sacred writings and oral teachings.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:10.381
The curriculum names the Bible in Christianity; the Qur’an and Hadith in Islam; and

00:00:10.381 --> 00:00:14.380
sacred myths, folktales, parables and taboos in African Traditional Religion.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:18.778
Followers may use these teachings to learn values and guide conduct.

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:24.620
Learners can listen respectfully and identify messages about kindness, truth and care

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.790
for others. No child has to profess another person’s faith.

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:34.636
Ask a trusted adult to share a short moral story from their tradition and discuss its

00:00:34.636 --> 00:00:34.950
lesson.
